resources/formats/drivel.typ:6:15: [1] "quick as lightning" -> Cliché: say it in your own words.
resources/formats/drivel.typ:14:16: [2] "software program" -> Redundant: “program” says it.
resources/formats/drivel.typ:14:76: [3] "utilize" -> Prefer: use.
